<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>07 / 试卷与生涯</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>整卷作答分析：用时间线还原失分过程</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 620, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={620} height={400} viewBox='0 0 620 400'><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='400' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><rect x='0' y='26' width='620' height='14' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='16' y='26' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>StudyAgent</text><rect x='18' y='58' width='584' height='26' rx='4' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='30' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>整卷作答分析 · 用时分布与回放</text><rect x='18' y='92' width='584' height='160' rx='6' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><text x='310.0' y='114' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>各题时间块：首次作答 / 返回修改 / 检查 / 跨题停顿</text><rect x='40' y='136' width='528' height='9' rx='4' fill='#DFE6EF'/><rect x='542' y='136' width='46' height='9' rx='4' fill='#CBD8E8'/><rect x='40' y='166' width='458' height='9' rx='4' fill='#E9EFF6'/><rect x='542' y='166' width='46' height='9' rx='4' fill='#CBD8E8'/><rect x='40' y='196' width='388' height='9' rx='4' fill='#DFE6EF'/><rect x='542' y='196' width='46' height='9' rx='4' fill='#CBD8E8'/><rect x='18' y='264' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='296' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>四类失分方向：掌握问题 / 时间策略 / 执行熟练度 / 临场状态</text><rect x='18' y='324' width='584' height='28' rx='14' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='30' y='343' font-size='14' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>可核对依据 + 后续验证方式</text><rect x='18' y='360' width='584' height='34' rx='17' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='310.0' y='383' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>生成下一步训练或复测建议</text><text x='608' y='390' font-size='12' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='end' font-weight='400'>示意占位 · S26</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>界面要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>逐题用时汇总多个作答时段，区分首次作答、返回修改与检查；跨题停顿单独保留。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>只有首末笔时间，不能准确代表一道题的全部思考时间；没有落笔也不代表没有读题、心算或规划。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>“这次确实在某题停留很久”与“为什么停留很久”需要分开记录。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>建议须对应具体行为，如“下一次先完成可独立解决的题目，再返回卡住的题”，而非笼统的“提高效率”。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>可观察事实、模型可能原因、教师或学生确认信息分别保留，不能把 AI 归因直接当训练真值。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ marginTop: 6, padding: '9px 14px', background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 6, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>示意占位 S26 · 待替换为实际截图</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：试卷与生涯维度设计思路.md §5</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 70 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>